WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.650
I witnessed a myth.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.680
We've learned two things.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.150
That Heroic Spirit's identity is still 
unknown, but his class is Archer.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.050
A second Archer?

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.550
Also, there's no chance of victory for us.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.450
We should forget about retrieving that Card, 
and search for a different solution.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.380
I concur.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.340
Frankly, I don't want to fight that again.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.210
But if we just leave it like this...

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.550
Anyway, we'll report to the Mages Association—

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.600
What? What was that sound?

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.480
What in the world is this?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.150
What's going on?

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.070
Wind?

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.850
Could this be...

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.660
How is this even possible?

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:43.850
<b>Episode 8 
Observer</b>

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:48.100
No way.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:52.100
<i>Impossible. How could the enemy 
break through the Mirror World?</i>

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.440
<i>This is bad. We have to act.</i>

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.650
<i>But what...</i>

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.650
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.890
<i>I never imagined we'd be on this
side when I used our last resort.</i>

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.050
<i>Sign!</i>

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.090
The ceiling's...

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.260
It's collapsing!

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:22.760
We're getting out of here!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.930
Illya, Miyu! Carry Luvia and me with you!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.390
A-All right!

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.390
Yes.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.980
<i>Es ist groß.</i>

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.600
<i>Es ist klein!</i>

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.100
So light!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.070
That's what the spell is for.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:38.280
And we're stuck on foot, huh?

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.360
What happened, Nee-san?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.350
Was the enemy able to transverse 
the imaginary axis, as well?

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.060
I don't know. But most likely,

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.210
that last sword tore the Mirror World apart.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.690
<i>There's a Noble Phantasm capable of that?</i>

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.170
What is that black thing?!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.170
How would I know?

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.770
Hurry, Illya!

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:45.840
Right!

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.900
Hurry, to the surface!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.950
It's not attacking?

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.940
That's a big problem in itself.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.200
Oh, no... The enemy's headed for the city!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.260
I'd like to lure him away from the city,

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.880
but I can't do anything while he's in the air.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.730
Illya and I can fly.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.400
If we settle this in the air...

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.710
That's too dangerous!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.390
If even a single Noble Phantasm falls on the city...

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:40.050
Then we'll draw him toward the sea 
or drop him to the ground!

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:41.300
And then what?

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:44.690
After throwing all we had at him didn't work?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:51.200
B-But that doesn't mean we can just leave him!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.620
Something...

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.370
There has to be something.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.500
I hear pigs squealing.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:01.880
Huh?

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.760
You?

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.530
Good grief.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:11.010
Two mages of prestigious families and an 
enforcer, all lined up and squealing away.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.460
Wh-Why are you here?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.000
Caren-sensei?!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.570
You're pathetic.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:31.280
Who is this rude woman? 
A friend of yours, Illya?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:35.060
Not really a friend. 
She's a teacher at our school...

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:38.110
Caren Hortensia of the Holy Church,

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:42.710
sent as backup for retrieval of 
the Cards, and as an observer.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:46.090
The Holy Church?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:50.300
Another organization that opposes the 
Mages Association we belong to.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:55.260
Though at the moment, we have forged a truce.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:07:00.480
Uh... Then, you were lying 
about being a school nurse?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.730
It wasn't exactly a lie. It's a hobby.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.460
I enjoy seeing injured children up close.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:07.860
It's hilarious!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.450
<i>This woman is broken as a person!</i>

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:13.910
I hadn't intended to take overt action,

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:18.310
but you lost lambs were so pathetic and pitiful.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:19.370
What?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:25.130
For starters, you should understand your 
place before whining so pathetically.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:28.340
You fools, who won't even pray to God.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.510
Are you insulting us?

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:33.260
I don't even need to go that far.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:37.560
Your eyes are full of holes, your head is empty,

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.730
and your hands can hold nothing.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.910
But that's all the more reason

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:48.180
that you should open those holes in your eyes 
and wrack that empty head of yours.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:52.240
Even if you can't reach anything, 
struggle to extend your hands.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:57.080
Observe, analyze, and act.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.120
That's really all you can do, is it not?

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.570
<i>Observe that... No.</i>

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:18.100
<i>I must observe this situation as a whole.</i>

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:26.980
There are no lights in the city.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:27.940
Huh?

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.080
The only lights on are street lamps.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.410
I don't see any building lights at all!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.570
Correct.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:39.240
Around this city is a Bounded Field to put 
its people to sleep and keep others out.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:40.950
Why?

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.840
Because that is one of my duties.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.020
<i>Then they anticipated this happening, too?</i>

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.840
<i>I don't like that very much, but...</i>

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.920
Well, we'll use anything we can get right now.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:58.510
Now... With that, you don't need to 
worry about anyone seeing you.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.100
So where should you look next?

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:06.560
I can't say I'm fond of you leading 
us along. But that's obvious.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.030
It's what we should do about him.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.050
But he just keeps floating up there.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.290
He's not doing anything at all.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:18.910
So then, at the very least, he has no 
intention of attacking indiscriminately?

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.310
Well, I guess that's what it amounts to...

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:23.080
<i>Intention?</i>

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:27.260
<i>A black Heroic Spirit, who's supposed to 
be a mere phenomenon, has a will?</i>

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.520
<i>What does this mean?</i>

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:33.300
Regardless, it doesn't look like he's 
going to take action immediately.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:37.530
In which case, we should focus on 
recovering our stamina for a while.

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:40.430
Well, we do need to take a break.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.390
Yes, that cannot be helped.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.840
Are you all right with that, too?

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:44.850
Understood.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.950
Y-Yeah.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:50.940
You're right. This may be our only chance to rest.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:56.520
Now, we can't exactly enjoy 
tea in a place like this.

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.830
I hope there's a place nearby 
where we can relax.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.000
What's wrong?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.040
Caren-sensei...

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:20.300
Um, there's one thing I have to ask you...

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:21.760
What is it?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.790
Did...

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.590
Did you forget to wear your skirt?!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:29.870
This is...

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.570
my fashion.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.080
I'm home.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:49.380
Hey... You're not "home," Bazett-san.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.050
This is the beach hut that Tatsuko's family runs!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.940
That's not a problem.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.260
I'm employed by those who run this place.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:57.320
Huh?

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:00.950
And in this country, they have a saying...

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.200
"Staff is family"!

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.230
There you have it.

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:10.700
No, I don't think so...

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:14.310
Well, what's done is done, right?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:15.800
It's an emergency.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.650
We can't ask for permission after the fact.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.990
I already left compensation.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.950
I guess we can't help it...

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.090
That reminds me, where's Miyu?

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:32.290
Outside. She said she can't stop 
thinking about that thing.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.140
That exhibitionist is already watching it,

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:38.330
so I wish she'd rest while we have the chance...

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:46.950
<i>I still don't know what Miyu's thinking 
or what burden she's bearing.</i>

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:51.230
<i>But the person here is definitely Miyu.</i>

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.730
<i>The same Miyu that was with us, and used to smile.</i>

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:04.950
Hey, Illya?

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:08.990
Wh-What?

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.950
I used a lot of mana.

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:14.710
While we can, let's find a quiet place to do it.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:18.250
Hey, you don't have to pull. I'll go.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.670
Hey, Kuro!

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:30.800
What is it, Kuro?

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:33.120
If you need your mana replenished, hurry.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:37.260
You and I both heard the same thing.

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:39.440
Right before we escaped the Mirror World.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:43.240
Holy Grail!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.320
Y-Yeah.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.970
Do you understand what that means?

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:52.790
If we're to believe Mama, the Cards 
aren't related to the Holy Grail War.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.440
But despite that, he said those words.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:56.580
Do you understand?

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:59.370
I don't get it...

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.310
You don't get it? Or you're pretending not to?

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:07.080
There's Miyu, too.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.770
You need to get your act together.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.870
Oh, don't mind me. Continue.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.670
We're already finished.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:36.370
What do you need? What about your task?

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.350
He hasn't made any move yet.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:42.100
But there's something I've noticed.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:44.000
Call everyone together.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:50.390
The angle of his rotation is changing slightly.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:55.250
It feels like he's searching for 
something while he's up there.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.700
Searching? For what?

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:01.270
Do you have any information that might 
enable us to predict his goals?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.730
Information? How would we...

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:07.440
He uttered the words, "Holy Grail."

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:09.870
Illya and I heard that, too.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:11.570
"Holy Grail"?

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.200
I find it hard to believe that's 
a meaningless utterance.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:19.420
If I recall, the name of the large-scale 
ritual the Einzberns tried to complete

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.170
was the "Holy Grail War."

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:25.160
But I heard that ended ten years ago.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:28.130
Does this have anything to do 
with that Holy Grail War?

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.740
<i>The Holy Grail War,</i>

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:34.850
<i>the ritual Kuro and I were 
supposed to be the keys to...</i>

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:39.310
Well, it seems to me you 
practically have the answer.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.440
He moved!

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:47.150
Where is he heading?

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.600
He said "Holy Grail," didn't he?

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.620
Then isn't it obvious?

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.800
To where the Holy Grail sleeps.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.780
The bowels of Mt. Enzou.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.290
That great cavern.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.030
<i>Who in the world is she?</i>

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.830
<i>Just how much does she know?</i>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.460
At this rate, we'll lose sight of him!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:06.960
We're pursuing the enemy!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:08.670
Miyu!

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:10.630
Me, too!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:11.340
Ruby!

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:15.750
Illya!

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.100
Listen! Only follow him!

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.870
Do not fight him until we catch up!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:20.640
Okay!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.930
Now... What will they do?

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:35.030
Miyu-sama, don't get too close.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:36.490
I know.

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:40.780
Clearly, he's heading straight for Mt. Enzou.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:45.040
What in the world did Caren-sama mean

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.540
by "where the Holy Grail sleeps"?

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.760
She probably...

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:50.760
Miyu!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.680
I finally caught up to you.

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:54.760
Illya...

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.810
Then it really is the Holy Grail War?

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:04.440
Yes.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.840
The ritual the Einzberns 
conducted ten years ago,

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.600
to call down the vessel of wishes.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:13.930
It appears this incident was 
brought forth by its remnants.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.260
But that was incorrect.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:22.130
At the very least, the Class Cards are 
unrelated to our Holy Grail War.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.880
To start with, what is the "Holy Grail War"...

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:30.130
No, what is the "Holy Grail" it speaks of, exactly?

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.520
That phrase has several different meanings,

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.840
so it's hard to describe in one sentence, but...

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:41.100
First, the core of the ritual 
is a giant magic circle that

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:44.500
draws and collects vast mana from the ley lines.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.290
That is the Holy Grail's magic formula.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:51.730
Illya and I are meant to play the parts 
of the keys to operate that formula.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.000
Lesser Holy Grails, if you will.

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:55.160
But...

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.880
We didn't end up that way.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:02.620
The Holy Grail War ended before 
it was completed, ten years ago.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.820
The Holy Grail never formed,

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:08.590
and the formula should still rest, 
half-broken, in the giant cavern.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.520
Either way, that's over.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.470
The problem is what's happening now.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.020
If he were seeking the Lesser Grail,

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:25.280
he should be targeting me or Illya.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:29.330
But right now, he isn't targeting 
either of us in particular.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.650
True.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.560
If he's pursuing the Holy Grail's formula,

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.980
it wouldn't be strange for him 
to head for Mt. Enzou.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:43.120
But that should be broken. There's no point to it.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:48.490
Yes... If you consider it along with the 
current state of our Holy Grail War,

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:50.620
then the enemy's actions are contradictory.

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:54.760
So you're saying the Einzberns' 
Holy Grail War is unrelated?

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.770
The Holy Church has observed the 
great cavern for the past ten years.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.470
We have not observed any
activation of the formula.

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:06.230
Also, the Einzberns' Holy Grail 
War never incorporated

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:09.520
Cards for summoning Heroic Spirits.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:13.760
If you think of it starting from our 
Holy Grail War, the logic doesn't add up.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:18.990
But it's hard to believe the Holy Grail War's 
concept is entirely unrelated.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:22.430
Only one answer explains the 
enemy's contradictory actions.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.790
I think you've just about guessed now...

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:29.710
Right, Luvia?

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:33.400
In other words, you're trying to say...

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.980
That aside from the one run by the Einzberns,

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:43.760
another Holy Grail War exists.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.410
This is ridiculous...

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:03.120
The ground has evaporated, 
and the great cavern is exposed!

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.090
The ground is cracking open?

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.460
There's something below...

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:23.620
No way.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.690
Why...

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.970
Why is that here?

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:33.970
A magic circle?

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.280
Something like this was beneath 
the great cavern?

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:38.940
That's an absurdly large, complicated formula!

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:44.170
Hey,

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.330
I think this is bad...

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.500
At this rate, we'll be in big trouble!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:50.620
Illya!

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:52.280
Help me, Miyu!

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:54.340
We'll push him outside the magic circle!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.250
That's dangerous, Illya-san!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:02.470
Rin-san told you not to fight him, didn't she?

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.570
I know.

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:07.940
But if I don't stop him, I don't think 
we'll be able to turn back!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.020
<i>Schneiden!</i>

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.800
Maximum output... Shoot!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:14.690
Where's the enemy?

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:17.270
Still inside that swirl!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.860
But the mist has cleared!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.530
Now we can directly

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.030
push the enemy out!

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:24.320
Hurry.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.580
We have to stop this ritual!

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:31.500
<i>Hurry. Hurry... Hurry!</i>

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.150
<i>What's this?</i>

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:36.590
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.960
<i>We didn't make it...</i>

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:41.050
...in time?

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:43.660
Oh?

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:27.210
The enemy's still intact in that swirl.

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:28.840
We failed to push him out?

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:29.880
But then, what's that?

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:32.640
Illya!

00:22:33.220 --> 00:22:36.250
Wh-What on Earth happened?

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.460
Huh? There's something soft in my hand...

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:45.400
I-Illya, that's...

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:46.460
Huh?

00:22:50.630 --> 00:22:52.220
Ow!

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:55.770
Can't you be a little more gentle with me?

00:22:57.460 --> 00:23:00.560
Oh, I'm talking about the left hand, too.

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:05.790
Hey, hey!

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:07.490
Isn't that rude, right off the bat?

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:11.370
What the heck? I'm the one 
who wants to scream...

00:23:12.130 --> 00:23:14.240
Wh-What's the meaning of this?

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>I touched it! I touched it! 
I touched it! I touched it!</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:20.210
<i>I squeezed it!</i>

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:22.420
It was

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:23.830
no use...

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:29.200
Though I rejected it, struggled against it, 
and ran from it, it was futile.

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:30.680
This is

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.350
my fate.

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:36.330
<b>Golden Boy</b>
